        <mxCell id="c222" value="&lt;i&gt;Report view, page Ex 13.6 Draft, for fiscal 2026 except the line chart, which spans every month. The pie has five slices and no labels; the card averages the Discount of each line; the line chart&#x27;s value axis starts at 1.0M, not at zero; the combo chart&#x27;s discounts have an axis of their own (outlined), and its hidden filter leaves out Services, which nothing on the page says.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="580" width="860" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c217" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#B03A2E;strokeWidth=2.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="782" y="322" width="54" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
